+ * combo0_dp_set_rate(), case 2700, of the vendor driver
+ * (bsp/drivers/phy/sunxi-cadence-combophy.c:1158-1385) with usb_dp_state = 0 --
+ * i.e. Type-C pin assignment C/E, four DP lanes and no SuperSpeed. That is the
+ * branch the 8 GiB board's capture below was taken on, so the two describe the same
+ * thing. ssc_en = 0, matching that capture.
