+ * reg_offset_shift = 1 -- byte offset = index << 1, exactly the mapping `phy-allwinner-a733-add-serdes-combophy`
+ * validated on silicon here. 151 of the 156 indices below therefore carry a
+ * register name taken from that driver rather than invented; the five that do
+ * not (0x004B, 0xC010, 0xC011, 0xE005, 0xE006) are left unnamed, and the UM does
+ * not name them either.
