+ * One mark per line and "t" wins, so the column reads 63 blank, 16 t, 49 u,
+ * 24 z, 4 x over the 156 unique indices: the 16 t are the 8 that agreed, the 4
+ * that would be z and the 4 that differ. The three headline counts above are
+ * the same 156 classified without the t overlay.
+ */
